     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">President Donald J. Trump attends G7 working session V, on AI and the digital age, at the Hotel Royal Evian, Wednesday, June 17, 2026, in Evian-les-Bains, France.(Official White House Photo by Daniel Torok)</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
